    "name": "Roasted Hazelnuts 4 oz",
    "description": "<p>\"These are our roasted hazelnuts harvested right here in the southern Willamette Valley. Cream them to delicious butter, crush them into a crust, or enjoy them whole—have a taste, they are so good! Our Hazelnuts are certified organic by Oregon Tilth and packed full of healthy fats, proteins, vitamins and minerals. Our trees are grown along the Coast Fork Willamette River in rich alluvial soils teeming with life—making our nuts among the tastiest in the world.\"<br><br>4 &amp; 12 oz bags packaged in 100% compostable packaging.</p>",
